  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。うま味の成分を　多く　含んでいるのでいろんなポケモンに　人気なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛이 강한 식재료. 감칠맛이 나는 성분을 많이 포함하고 있어서 다양한 포켓몬에게 인기가 많다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味強勁的食材。富含帶有鮮味的成分，所以受到許多寶可夢的喜愛。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très acide. Très apprécié par divers Pokémon grâce à plusieurs éléments lui donnant une saveur umami unique.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr saure Zutat, die durch ihre zahlreichen umami Komponenten bei vielen Pokémon hoch im Kurs steht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene un fuerte sabor ácido, pero también un toque umami que lo hace muy popular entre los Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto aspro, amato da tanti Pokémon per via della sapidità di molte delle sostanze che contiene.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very tart ingredient has a lot of savory elements to it, making it popular with many Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。うま味の成分を　多く　含んでいるのでいろんなポケモンに　人気なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味强烈的食材。含有许多鲜味成分，所以受到各种宝可梦欢迎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
